  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A point particle of mass <em>m</em> is positioned at a distance of <em>r</em><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"_{1}\"></span> and <em>r</em><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"_{2}\"></span> from point particles with mass <em>m</em><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"_{1}\"></span>and <em>m</em><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"_{2}\"></span>respectively. The net gravitational force acting on <em>m</em> is <em>F</em>.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the magnitude of <em>F </em>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Gm\\left (m_{1}r_{1}^{2}+m_{2}r_{2}^{2}\\right )}{\\left (r_{1}r_{2} \\right )^{2}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Gm\\left (m_{1}r_{1}^{2}-m_{2}r_{2}^{2}\\right )}{\\left (r_{1}r_{2} \\right )^{2}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Gm\\left (m_{1}r_{2}^{2}+m_{2}r_{1}^{2}\\right )}{\\left (r_{1}r_{2} \\right )^{2}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Gm\\left (m_{1}r_{2}^{2}-m_{2}r_{1}^{2}\\right )}{\\left (r_{1}r_{2} \\right )^{2}}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
